  "description": "Following his younger sibling’s last request, he searches for Lee Haeseung—the woman believed to be the child’s biological mother. A DNA test reveals an unsettling result: no parent–child match, yet the same maternal lineage. Drawn to the pale, fragile woman hiding secrets beneath the afternoon light, he must uncover the truth behind a bold transgression.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13742784), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885051543)",
